{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02905","headline":"奉和圣制过温汤 · 王德真","name":"奉和圣制过温汤","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"握图开万宇，属圣啓千年。\n骊阜疏缇骑，惊鸿映彩旃。\n玉霜鸣凤野，金阵藻龙川。\n祥烟聚危岫，德水溢飞泉。\n停舆兴睿览，还举大风篇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王德真","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02905.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02905","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}